# Final checklist

When the user says "final checklist", open `docs/hackathon/final-checklist.md` and do the sections in order.

- Tick a box only after its done-when line is true.
- Write a blocker under a box you cannot finish, then continue.
- Use only profile and live URLs the checklist, the repo, Vercel, or the user already gave you.
- The last demo frame is `/pitch`: live URL, repo, and one QR each for Mangle Kuo and Cornelius Hagmeister.
- Do not commit unless the user asked in that turn.
